DATA ATTRIBUTION

This project includes visualizations and sample data derived from
publicly available trajectory datasets. The original data is governed
by its respective source licenses and is NOT redistributed in this
repository. Only small samples (≤ 50 rows per city) and aggregated
analysis figures (PNG) are included for illustration.

Original data sources:
- Beijing T-Drive: Microsoft Research Asia T-Drive project
- Shenzhen 2014: Public trajectory dataset (2014-10-22)
- Wuxi 2020: Public vehicle trajectory dataset (2020-07-18 ~ 2020-08-17)
